WEBVTT

00:00:00.719 --> 00:00:06.560
This little flashlight.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:09.920
What's that? Oh, no. I'm not going to

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.280
You think I'm going to shine a light

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.440
into your eyeballs? That's kind of mean,

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.560
isn't it? No. No. I'm just going to like

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.560
move it around.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.400
Yeah.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.720
What? Did someone shine lights into your

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:25.279
eyes? Where did this happen? Who did

00:00:25.279 --> 00:00:28.080
that to you?

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.199
I'll have to have a word with HR.

00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:34.239
Good.

00:00:34.239 --> 00:00:37.600
Excellent.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:57.039
Bad.

00:00:57.039 --> 00:01:02.039
There.
